        "description": "<p>WordPress 5.5 introduces a new feature that adds basic extensible XML sitemap functionality to WordPress core.<br />\nThis functionality does not imply settings and all pages are displayed in the sitemap.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload dir <code>wp-sitemap-computy</code> to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress</li>\n</ol>\n",
